  "question": {
    "text": "A circular disc reaches from top to bottom of an inclined plane of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo></math> When it slips down the plane, it takes time&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>. When it rolls down the plane, it takes time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/094de34b-1578-4def-abe9-772547d0b2b5-image.png\" style=\"width: 244px; height: 235px;\" /></p><p>If disk slips on inclined plane, then its acceleration,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>If disk rolls on inclined plane, its acceleration,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math><br />Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
